  "2026-10-06T09:32:33.780Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: live strict full all-status corpus2895/2895, zero unreadable records, omissions or truncation; all694 GitHub issues read for canonical links; request-specific search and open/in-progress inventories inspected. No dedicated amount-only/nonbinding-budget owner exists. Closed pm-gh1411 and pm-gh1371 own different completed composed-ceiling repairs, preserved here as precursor lineage. GH-1413 full report retained; reproduction and implementation follow in this single combined PR."
  "2026-10-06T09:39:09.207Z","harness:codex","TDD reproduced GH-1413: both amount-only output-budget variants failed on stale producer coordinates (24 rather than delivered index 1). Implemented rebase before token projection; preserving explicit terminal null cursor semantics. Verification now includes ordered list/search continuations and packed Node/Bun consumers."
  "2026-10-06T10:05:27.035Z","harness:codex","First full verification found only a directory-load violation from new root-level test files: 9788 tests passed, one organization assertion failed. Moved new CLI producer regressions into tests/integration/cli and conflict guard tests into tests/unit/sdk/lifecycle, retaining the 120-file cap. Static lint also identified excessive complexity in the enlarged continuation matrix; extracted substantive traversal/assertion routines and reused ordering/setup without changing coverage policy. Early linked runs timed out while queued behind the full-suite build lease; preserve those receipts and rerun serially."
  "2026-10-06T10:11:06.438Z","harness:codex","All current linked regressions pass after moving new test files into bounded directories. The standalone temporary-directory acceptance also passed with the actual npm-packed publish tree: npm and bun installs, Node and Bun SDK consumers, npx and bunx invocations, and ordered complete list/search continuation across unbounded and finite budgets. Explicit terminal caps remain partial and do not invent continuations. Initial linked timeout receipts are preserved; those runs waited behind the exclusive full-coverage lease and were rerun serially successfully. Final full coverage and remaining repository gates are pending."
  "2026-10-06T10:12:35.170Z","harness:codex","Final workflow review found that the expanded packed-consumer regression executes Bun while coverage shards previously guaranteed only Node. Added the already pinned setup-bun action and repository Bun version to coverage shards, making the public-runtime test reproducible without assuming preinstalled runner software. This is part of the same combined delivery and does not weaken the coverage matrix or thresholds."
  "2026-10-06T10:24:29.106Z","harness:codex","Second full run retained 9788 passing tests and caught one timeout in the existing absence-tolerance default-repository scanner; no coverage summary was emitted, so this is recorded as a failed verification rather than 100-percent evidence. Current tracked source behavior and all linked/manual checks pass. Inspect the scanner and rerun its real suite in isolation, then rerun full coverage with competing heavy typechecking and tracker scans finished. No timeout, retry or coverage threshold is being weakened."
  "2026-10-06T10:26:59.855Z","harness:codex","The existing absence-tolerance gate suite passes 19/19 in isolation in about two seconds. Full coverage is rerunning with four workers and unchanged test timeouts, retries, source include/exclude policy and exact four-metric thresholds. Fresh GitHub intake still has 28 open issues and no open PR, Dependabot, code-scanning or secret-scanning alerts; GH-1413 is the only issue awaiting its newly created canonical record link, which will be added with the pushed delivery. Current complete graph audit:2896 nodes/14487 directed edges, no missing targets, isolates, sparse nodes, ordering contradictions/cycles or unreachable outcomes; only the seven established legacy hierarchy subjects remain informational."
  "2026-10-06T10:57:27.315Z","harness:codex","Repository assurance exposed an unregistered recurrence component containing the closed pm-gh1411 precursor and this new residual. Registered the historical precursor under output-budget-and-continuation version4, without inventing another edge or changing any budget. The authoritative complete population now covers178/178 recorded recurrence items, with no missing or uncovered members; the captured-boundary/terminal-defect negative control still exits1 as required. A live assurance risk request naming only pm-gh1413 selects the output-budget family and its existing local/hosted checks. Generated full contracts now include the stable existing-item code and typed task-composition refusal source."
  "2026-10-06T11:49:31.723Z","harness:codex","Local completion: All 15 linked producer/consumer cases pass with exact ordered traversal and both runtime exports; real installed Node and Bun consumers each traverse 30 rows with four amount-only cases and no skips or duplicates. Canonical full suite passes 9789 runnable tests with only two established Windows-only skips. All 764 maintained source files have zero uncovered counts: statements66841/66841; branches51174/51174; functions13809/13809; lines63702/63702. Complete static pipeline, all four TypeScript configurations, 58 token surfaces, docs links, packed artifact and nine-package npx/bunx smoke pass. Bunx smoke uses a fresh owned temporary cache after the host cache symlink was refused; no host cache or gate is weakened. Required current production Sentry/telemetry gate passes with zero blocking issues and finish-error rate2.06% with zero missing error-code rows. Hosted exact-head review remains required before merge; this is implemented local-source evidence and does not claim published registry adoption."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-06T10:28:44.116Z","harness:codex","Producer pagination coordinates must reflect rows delivered after every projection stage, including an amount cap when token cost does not bind. Capture source coordinates before projection and reuse them for composed rebasing, so token compaction cannot subtract the amount reduction twice. Regressions compare exact ordered IDs through unchanged serialized CLI and independently packed SDK reads; terminal deliberate caps remain distinct from advertised resumable pages."
